  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pattern: Xを{略|りゃく}す.\n\nALTERNATE FORM: {略|りゃく}する (する-verb form) is also common.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{以下|いか}→以下：01294_ika⟧{略|りゃく} (the rest is omitted)\n- ⟦{中|なか}→中：00654_naka⟧{略|りゃく} (middle portion omitted)\n- ⟦{前|まえ}→前：02255_mae⟧{略|りゃく} (opening omitted - in letters)\n- ⟦{後|あと}→後：09580_ato⟧{略|りゃく} (remainder omitted)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{略語|りゃくご}→略語：21705_ryakugo⟧ (abbreviation)\n- ⟦{略称|りゃくしょう}→略称：13562_ryakushou⟧ (abbreviated name)\n- ⟦{省略|しょうりゃく}→省略：03244_shouryaku⟧ (omission, abbreviation)",
